WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.650
Headlights emerge from near darkness. A satin black delivery truck approaches a dimly lit loading bay.

00:04.650 --> 00:07.300
A close-up reveals the champagne foil Wholesale Gods identity on the truck.

00:07.300 --> 00:09.200
A luminous halo opens beside the truck. Mist curls above the wet floor.

00:09.200 --> 00:14.200
A branded parcel rises through the halo and moves into an aperture on the cargo side.

00:14.200 --> 00:19.000
The halo fades. The truck accelerates away, leaving a trace of mist.

00:19.000 --> 00:22.000
On black: Your package is on its way. Wholesale Gods.
